From: Tiberiu Chibici <chibicitiberiu@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 22:42:17 +0200
Subject: config: fullscreen by default (Walnut is a console on a TV)

A fresh neverballrc started Neverball and Neverputt in an 800x600 window.
Fullscreen already takes the desktop's mode (SDL_WINDOW_FULLSCREEN_DESKTOP,
1920x1080 on the PS3), so only the default changes. The Options menu and
a saved neverballrc still change it.

Forwarded: not-needed

diff --git a/share/config.c b/share/config.c
--- a/share/config.c
+++ b/share/config.c
@@ -129,7 +129,7 @@ static struct
     const int   def;
     int         cur;
 } option_d[] = {
-    { &CONFIG_FULLSCREEN,   "fullscreen",   0 },
+    { &CONFIG_FULLSCREEN,   "fullscreen",   1 },  /* Walnut: a console on a TV */
     { &CONFIG_DISPLAY,      "display",      0 },
     { &CONFIG_WIDTH,        "width",        800 },
     { &CONFIG_HEIGHT,       "height",       600 },
